{"id":"tochno","lemma":"точно","pos":"adv","rank":127,"glosses":["exactly, precisely, accurately","definitely"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/2c/Ru-%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%87%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%87%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ты точно хочешь это знать?","en":"Are you sure you want to know?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1265856","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…"}]},{"text":"Как мы можем точно знать?","en":"How can we know for sure?","words":[{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},null,{"g":"to know: to be familiar…"}]},{"text":"Я точно знаю, кто это.","en":"I know exactly who it is.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"this / it is"}]},{"text":"Ты точно знаешь, что делать?","en":"Are you sure you know what to do?","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"to make, to do"}]},{"text":"Я точно знаю, куда хочу пойти.","en":"I know exactly where I want to go.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"where?"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to go"}]}]}